          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 127,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:1",
          "start": 111
        },
        "quote": "(b) Definitions.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.110 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "1504a7a5-05e0-5bfe-8578-43444ec9acad",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 683,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:2",
          "start": 128
        },
        "quote": "(1) “Nudity” means the showing of the human male or female genitals, anus, anal cleft or anal cleavage, or the showing of the female breast below a horizontal line across the top of the areola at its highest point with less than a fully opaque covering. This definition shall include the entire lower portion of the human female breast, but shall not include any portion of the cleavage of the human female breast exhibited by a dress, blouse, shirt, leotard, bathing suit, or other wearing apparel, provided the areola is not exposed in whole or in part.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.110 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "bcacac32-93af-5914-a4ea-5da3a9bfa88c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 951,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:3",
          "start": 684
        },
        "quote": "(2) “Public place” means any location frequented by the public, or where the public is present or likely to be present, including but not limited to streets, avenues, highways, roads, waterways, stores, meeting facilities, or businesses and commercial establishments.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.110 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "835c201a-749a-5c80-826b-0f6ee91dd9e5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1375,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:4",
          "start": 952
        },
        "quote": "(3) “Places set apart for nudity” means public places outside of the home where nudity or exposure is necessary or customarily expected; including, but not limited to, public restrooms, enclosed single-sex functional shower, locker and/or dressing room facilities, enclosed motel rooms and hotel rooms designed and intended for sleeping accommodations, doctor’s offices and portions of hospitals set apart for this purpose.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.110 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "5efc20fd-d5a1-5356-8bba-8a31fce74681",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1448,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:5",
          "start": 1376
        },
        "quote": "(c) The provisions of subsection (a) of this section shall not apply to:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.110 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "e5955fa7-8b00-5253-a743-f5a8d5c6e78e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1489,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:6",
          "start": 1449
        },
        "quote": "(1) A child under the age of five years.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.110 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "e55eb6fa-36aa-5f13-9913-67df5d7b9c41",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1527,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:7",
          "start": 1490
        },
        "quote": "(2) A mother breastfeeding her child.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
