          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:8",
          "start": 1528
        },
        "quote": "(3) Places set apart for nudity.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.110 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "ac63ee18-d26e-5c7e-b123-b27b7c35e60b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1892,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:9",
          "start": 1561
        },
        "quote": "(4) Any theater, concert hall, art center, museum or similar establishment that is primarily devoted to the arts or theatrical performances and in which nudity is incorporated into the art exhibit or theatrical performance and is not a mere guise or pretense used to exploit the conduct of being nude for profit or commercial gain.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.110 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "628d614f-5b78-577a-a687-4f19024e103c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2084,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:10",
          "start": 1893
        },
        "quote": "(5) Nudity incorporated into an educational curriculum at an accredited university, technical school or institution whose classes may transfer to an accredited university or technical school.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.110:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
